  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born from the dust and decay of Sector 7, Static was a glitch in the system, a digital echo in the concrete canyons of Subchain City. He scavenged tech scraps, piecing together his reality from the ruins around him, always searching for a signal in the noise.",
    "class": "Techno-Scavenger",
    "name": "Static Echo",
    "personality": "Cynical and resourceful. Static has seen too much to trust easily, preferring the company of machines to ducks. Quirky and unpredictable. His AI-enhanced senses give him a unique perspective on the world, often seeing patterns others miss, but also prone to sudden shifts in mood and erratic behavior. Obsessive and driven. Once Static sets his mind on a goal, he pursues it relentlessly, often to the detriment of his own well-being.",
